{"title":"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Three <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vertex\" title=\"Vertex\">vertices</a> of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cube\" title=\"Cube\">cube</a> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/a/8da418ac04db5f7380d9680364891298dfe69142.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P=(7,12,10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/0/ae0400255f11f8cf545102e60c6dab8ccd4ea401.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q=(8,8,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"98\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e51220fff25d02a7db3da457af90d91d271d8348.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R=(11,3,9)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" />. What is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Surface_area\" title=\"Surface area\">surface area</a> of the cube?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/7/8079888230bc912f27caec7ccaa3968f954de09f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ=\\sqrt{(8-7)^2+(8-12)^2+(1-10)^2}=\\sqrt{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"377\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/f/a3fd18457f5ea56b8a5aadf9be48da890d4d5b7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PR=\\sqrt{(11-7)^2+(3-12)^2+(9-10)^2}=\\sqrt{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"387\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/d/70da4f6b2646b17701e05713e6766b0a1dc20a34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QR=\\sqrt{(11-8)^2+(3-8)^2+(9-1)^2}=\\sqrt{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"367\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/c/91c587b0c1e5de0bde79b9d8c36913c16dee04d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> is an equilateral triangle which means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/c/91c587b0c1e5de0bde79b9d8c36913c16dee04d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> are the diagonals of 3 sides that share a vertex. \n</p><p>Let the side of the cube be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/3/733d7474934ead8b18697ea97f860bdb8c99e68a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ,PR,QR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" /> are diagonals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/e/f4edbeea131d132f20c8f4701ee01a10467143aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\sqrt{2}=\\sqrt{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/8/488bcbbfc44929fdf9b59dd95981d4c76546c72c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, and hence the surface area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/2/b32a5369998823867953ec107a1e170270d0bf46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6a^2=\\framebox{294}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"22\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II\" title=\"2002 AIME II\">2002 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2002\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"externa